    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "0732b0ebf28d38e945ea48f89a1d46a31c37b6205051cab08c6827945fb8c460",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 9,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "しかしニィルさんは、いつもの笑顔で肩をすくめると\n僕の頭を撫で、頬を撫で、もう一度頭を撫でた。",
      "jp_sha256": "0a0b166d88359d8cf455df5e2f865dab5acaeea8ad5566e8d3c797a1dd0272e3",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "하지만 니르 씨는 평소의 미소로 어깨를 으쓱하고\n내 머리를 쓰다듬고, 뺨을 쓰다듬고, 다시 머리를 쓰다듬었다.",
      "message_index_0based": 9,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 31,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b011-20261107-ff47d2c5b69e",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "5cfed47a39bd01f6a74ebe52290acd57e108295cf4fa00fc80c1298a05c111f9:000001_-709008094871157430:g0:r30",
      "row_index_0based": 30,
      "serialized_row_index": 30,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "しかしニィルさんは、いつもの笑顔で肩をすくめると\n僕の頭を撫で、頬を撫で、もう一度頭を撫でた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "901073a4ab5e59ffe6f500969a81fd7f78a5e2fc6e1b84fc53eaef3f8f3f50c3",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 10,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "マスターってば、相変わらず危機感がないというか\n危機管理がなってないというか……\n本当に何も分かっていないのね。",
      "jp_sha256": "f9f700d2f7b70e762d98fdd85a554aff7040a2bb517abcf84b55634d9cf0d08b",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "마스터는 여전히 위기감이 없다고 해야 할지\n위기 관리가 엉망이라고 해야 할지……\n정말 아무것도 모르는구나.",
      "message_index_0based": 10,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 32,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b011-20261107-ff47d2c5b69e",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
